### Replace one task
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Read chapters 1-47",
  "description": "Expanded reading scope before exam week.",
  "deadline": "2026-06-04T00:00:00Z",
  "status": "ongoing",
  "subject_id": 1
}

### Update one task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Delete one task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete all tasks
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/
Accept: application/json
